                            Interest
                            <i class="mdi mdi-help-circle text-primary ms-2" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" title="Interest: This section allows you to specify interest-related details for the loan application. Here's an overview of the key components:
Key Points:
1. Amortization Type: Select the type of amortization for the loan.
2. Interest Rate: Enter the interest rate applicable to the loan.
3. Apply Interest Waiver: Check this box if an interest waiver is applicable to this application.
4. Waiver Rate (%): If applicable, enter the percentage of interest waiver.
By accurately specifying these details, you can ensure transparency and clarity regarding interest-related terms, facilitating informed decision-making for both the borrower and the lender."></i>

                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="collapseDeliveryOptions"
                         class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                         aria-labelledby="headingDeliveryOptions"
                         data-bs-parent="#collapsibleSection">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            <div class="row g-4">
                                @*<div class="col-md-12">
                                        <div class="form-floating form-floating-outline">
                                            @Html.DropDownListFor(m => m.AddLoanApplicationCommand.AmortizationType, new SelectList(ViewBag.AmortizationTypes, "Value", "Text"), "---Select loan type---", new { @class = "form-control select2", @search = "true" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.AddLoanApplicationCommand.AmortizationType, "", new { @class = "text-danger " })
                                            <label>Select amortization type</label>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>*@
                                <div class="col-md-12">
                                    <div class="form-floating form-floating-outline">
